{"type":"message","id":"366a8268","parentId":"58c04d6e","timestamp":"2026-09-08T20:37:27.660Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"bash-1788899845674528584-79","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning: Permanently added '100.77.98.25' (ED25519) to the list of known hosts.\r\n# PROJECT KNOWLEDGE BASE\r\n\r\n**Generated:** 2026-09-05\r\n**Commit:** cd0ddb5\r\n**Branch:** main\r\n\r\n## OVERVIEW\r\nCharacter-centered grand-strategy SRPG set in post-collapse Seoul's subway network. Unity 6000.7.0a5 runs the game; repository-only Node/Python tooling validates architecture, documentation, asset provenance, and capture evidence.\r\n\r\n## STRUCTURE\r\n```text\r\nseoul-kenshi/\r\n|-- Game/                  # Unity project; engine and domain guidance in Game/AGENTS.md\r\n|   |-- Assets/Janseon/     # Production Core, Foundation, art and source candidates\r\n|   |-- Assets/Tests/      # EditMode and PlayMode validation\r\n|   `-- ProjectSettings/   # Serialized genre contract and build settings\r\n|-- docs/\r\n|   |-- adr/               # Accepted delivery policy\r\n|   |-- game-logic/        # Design corpus and repository-authoritative wiki source\r\n|   |-- assets/            # Wiki imagery, asset BOMs and review records\r\n|   `-- verification/      # Recorded evidence artifacts\r\n|-- tools/                 # Private ESM tooling, not shipped with Unity\r\n|   `-- art/               # Candidate processing, promotion and provenance contracts\r\n`-- .omo/evidence/         # Generated capture images and source-bound receipts\r\n```\r\n\r\n## WHERE TO LOOK\r\n| Task | Location | Notes |\r\n|------|----------|-------|\r\n| Design entry and navigation | `docs/game-logic/Home.md`, `_Sidebar.md` | Separate design intent from implementation status |\r\n| Architecture and rollout | `docs/game-logic/Unity-Architecture.md`, `Unity-System-Design.md`, `Unity-Architecture-Implementation-Plan.md` | Responsibilities, contracts, implementation sequence |\r\n| Sav